{title: Sunya Sunya Maifilit Mazhya}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar Hridaynath}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Sunya [F#]sunya maifi [C#m]lit mazya,        [E]Tujhech mi git [C#m]gaat [G#]ahe
[C#m]Ajunahi waatate [G#]mala ki,        [E]Ajunahi chaand [C#m]raat [G#]ahe
[C#m]Kale n mi paa [E]hate kunaala,        [C#m]Kale n ha che [B]hara kuna [C#m]acha
[G#]Punha punha [C#m]bhaas hot [G#]ahe,        [E]Tujhe hasu aras [C#m]haat [G#]ahe
[F#]Sakhya tula bheta [E]til [F#]maajhe,        [F#]Tujhya ghari [C#m]sur [E]olakhiche
[G#]Ubha tujhya [C#m]angani [G#]swaraancha,        [E]Abol ha paari [C#m]jaat [G#]ahe
[C#m]Ugich swapnaant [E]saawalyaanchi,        [C#m]Kashaas kelisa [B]arjawe [C#m]atu
[G#]Diles ka prem [C#m]tu [G#]kunaala,        [E]Tujhyaach je anta [C#m]raat [G#]ahe
